### Get Access Logs (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/admin/access-logs
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Users with Roles (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Login to get token first
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}
